[
  {
    "t": "head",
  },
  {
    "num": "No. C-2026-001",
    "t": "title",
    "text": "PRIVATE EQUIPMENT PURCHASE AND SALE AGREEMENT",
  },
  {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "**Valdir de Paula Bicudo ME**, registered under CNPJ (Brazilian company tax ID) no. 21.914.770/0001-10, State Registration Isento, headquartered at Rua São Marcos, 126 – Jardim São José, Jacareí – SP, ZIP 12327-668, herein represented by Valdir de Paula Bicudo, hereinafter simply referred to as the **SELLER**.",
  },
  {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "**Clínica Exemplo Ltda**, registered under CNPJ no. 12.345.678/0001-90, headquartered at Rua das Flores, 100 – Centro, São José dos Campos – SP, ZIP 12200-000, herein represented by Ana Souza, CPF 123.456.789-00, hereinafter simply referred to as the **BUYER**.",
  },
  {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "The parties above have agreed to the following:",
  },
  {
    "t": "ch",
    "text": "CLAUSE 1 – SUBJECT MATTER",
  },
  {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "The SELLER declares to be the lawful owner of the equipment listed below, which is sold to the BUYER in **used and serviced** condition:",
  },
  {
    "head": [
      "Equipment",
      "Serial no.",
    ],
    "rows": [
      [
        "Autoclave Sercon 21 litros",
        "SN12345",
      ],
      [
        "Seladora Cristófoli",
        "CR-998",
      ],
    ],
    "t": "table",
    "widths": [
      68,
      32,
    ],
  },
  {
    "t": "ch",
    "text": "CLAUSE 2 – PRICE AND PAYMENT",
  },
  {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "The total, fair and agreed price is **R$ 1.200,00 (one thousand two hundred reais)**, paid as follows: by PIX (instant bank transfer); metade na assinatura e metade na entrega.",
  },
  {
    "t": "ch",
    "text": "CLAUSE 3 – DELIVERY AND POSSESSION",
  },
  {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "The BUYER takes possession of the equipment on **October 5, 2026**, from which date the BUYER is responsible for its custody and care.",
  },
  {
    "t": "ch",
    "text": "CLAUSE 4 – TRANSPORT",
  },
  {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "The equipment will be shipped by a carrier chosen by the BUYER, who will bear the freight and the risks of transport.",
  },
  {
    "t": "ch",
    "text": "CLAUSE 5 – ORIGIN AND ENCUMBRANCES",
  },
  {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "The SELLER warrants that the equipment is free and clear of any lien, debt, seizure or restriction. Should the equipment be taken from the BUYER for a reason prior to this sale, the SELLER will refund the amount received, adjusted for inflation and increased by statutory interest.",
  },
  {
    "t": "ch",
    "text": "CLAUSE 6 – WARRANTY",
  },
  {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "a) The SELLER grants a warranty of **18 (dezoito) meses** against operating defects, counted from the delivery date of the equipment.",
  },
  {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "b) The warranty is void if the warranty seal is broken, if the equipment suffers a fall, accident or damage caused by third parties, or if it is connected to the wrong electrical voltage.",
  },
  {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "c) Warranty service is free of charge to the BUYER, who must request it by WhatsApp (12) 99788-1836 or by e-mail 4Vmanutencoes@gmail.com.",
  },
  {
    "t": "ch",
    "text": "CLAUSE 7 – INSTALLATION AND USE",
  },
  {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "The BUYER declares to have received the equipment tested and in working order and undertakes to install and use it according to the manufacturer’s manual, at the correct electrical voltage.",
  },
  {
    "t": "ch",
    "text": "CLAUSE 8 – GENERAL PROVISIONS",
  },
  {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "This agreement is entered into on an irrevocable and irreversible basis and binds the parties, their heirs and successors.",
  },
  {
    "t": "ch",
    "text": "CLAUSE 9 – JURISDICTION",
  },
  {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "The courts of the District of **Jacareí – SP** are chosen to settle any dispute relating to this agreement, waiving any other, however privileged.",
  },
  {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "In witness whereof, the parties sign this agreement in 2 (two) copies of equal content and form, in the presence of the 2 (two) witnesses below.",
  },
  {
    "t": "place",
    "text": "Jacareí, October 2, 2026.",
  },
  {
    "cols": [
      {
        "lines": [
          {
            "b": 1,
            "x": "SELLER",
          },
          {
            "x": "Valdir de Paula Bicudo ME",
          },
          {
            "x": "CNPJ 21.914.770/0001-10",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        "lines": [
          {
            "b": 1,
            "x": "BUYER",
          },
          {
            "x": "Clínica Exemplo Ltda",
          },
          {
            "x": "CNPJ 12.345.678/0001-90",
          },
        ],
      },
    ],
    "t": "sign",
  },
  {
    "cols": [
      {
        "lines": [
          {
            "b": 1,
            "x": "Witness 1",
          },
          {
            "x": "João Silva, CPF 111.222.333-44",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        "lines": [
          {
            "b": 1,
            "x": "Witness 2",
          },
          {
            "x": "Name: ____________________",
          },
          {
            "x": "CPF: ________________",
